Subject: [PATCH] art: add scoped Floral NativeBridge diagnostics

Add opt-in package and library filters around backend loading, trampolines, JNI_OnLoad, and RegisterNatives without changing routing behavior.

Change-Id: Ib4b19b116684fc37a92d5cb7528f1d218cdcb1ff
